  "term": "critical thinking",
  "definition": "Critical thinking is a higher-order thinking process that involves interpreting, analyzing, evaluating, and improving one’s reasoning about evidence, ideas, and methods. In psychology and education, it is described as important for cognitive development and engagement.",
